{"text":"purananuru","n":95,"lines":["இவ்வே பீலி அணிந்து மாலை சூட்டிக்","கண்திரள் நோன்காழ் திருத்தி நெய் அணிந்து","கடியுடை வியன்நக ரவ்வே அவ்வே","பகைவர்க் குத்திக் கோடுநுதி சிதைந்து","கொல்துறைக் குற்றில மாதோ என்றும்","உண் டாயின் பதம் கொடுத்து","இல் லாயின் உடன் உண்ணும்","இல்லோர் ஒக்கல் தலைவன்","அண்ணல்எம் கோமான் வைந் நுதி வேலே"],"tr":["ivvē pīli aṇintu mālai cūṭṭik","kaṇtiraḷ nōṉkāḻ tirutti ney aṇintu","kaṭiyuṭai viyaṉnaka ravvē avvē","pakaivark kuttik kōṭunuti citaintu","koltuṟaik kuṟṟila mātō eṉṟum","uṇ ṭāyiṉ patam koṭuttu","il lāyiṉ uṭaṉ uṇṇum","illōr okkal talaivaṉ","aṇṇalem kōmāṉ vain nuti vēlē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pāṭāṇ","tinai_ta":"பாடாண்","turai_ta":"வாண் மங்கலம்,","poet_ta":"ஔவையார்","addressed_ta":"அதியமான் நெடுமான் அஞ்சி","poet_tr":"Auvaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"iṇaikkuṟaḷ āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 2×3, 1×2 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 29, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 15, veṇṭaḷai 14, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"இவ்வே","tr":"ivvē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இவ்","tr":"iv"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"பீலி","tr":"pīli","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பீ","tr":"pī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லி","tr":"li"}]},{"text":"யணிந்துமாலை","tr":"yaṇintumālai","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யணிந்","tr":"yaṇin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துமா","tr":"tumā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"சூட்டிக்","tr":"cūṭṭik","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சூட்","tr":"cūṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டிக்","tr":"ṭik"}]}],[{"text":"கண்திரள்","tr":"kaṇtiraḷ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரள்","tr":"tiraḷ"}]},{"text":"நோன்காழ்","tr":"nōṉkāḻ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோன்","tr":"nōṉ"},{"kind":"nēr